---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Hyperspark Studio"
  description="How Hyperspark Studio collects, uses, and protects your information."
>

<section class="brief-page">
  <div class="container legal-container">
    <a href="/" class="brief-logo" aria-label="Hyperspark home">&gt;hyperspark</a>

    <div class="brief-head">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: July 12, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Hyperspark Studio ("Hyperspark", "we", "us") is a development studio that builds
        websites, apps, and AI-native products for founders. This policy explains what
        information we collect through <a href="/">hyperspark.studio</a> and how we use it.
        Questions: <a href="mailto:support@hyperspark.studio">support@hyperspark.studio</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect information you give us directly:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Product brief form:</strong> your name, email address, mobile number, and
          details about the product you want built.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Call bookings:</strong> the name, email, and scheduling details you provide
          when booking a call with us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong> anything you send to us at support@hyperspark.studio.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not run advertising trackers or sell data to third parties. Our hosting
        provider may collect standard server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited)
        for security and performance.
      </p>

      <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To review your product brief and respond to you.</li>
        <li>To schedule and hold calls you book with us.</li>
        <li>To communicate about a project you engage us for.</li>
        <li>To keep the site secure and functioning.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use your information for marketing lists unless you explicitly opt in.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>We rely on a small set of service providers to run the site:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Formspree</strong> — processes form submissions and delivers them to us.</li>
        <li><strong>Zcal</strong> — handles call scheduling.</li>
        <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — hosts the website.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Each processes your data under its own privacy policy, only as needed to provide
        its service to us.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep briefs and correspondence for as long as needed to evaluate or deliver a
        project, and for a reasonable period afterward for our records. You can ask us to
        delete your information at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of the personal information
        we hold about you. Email
        <a href="mailto:support@hyperspark.studio">support@hyperspark.studio</a> and we will
        respond within a reasonable timeframe.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served over HTTPS. Access to submitted briefs is limited to the
        Hyperspark team. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we
        take reasonable measures to protect your information.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our services are intended for founders and businesses. We do not knowingly collect
        information from anyone under 16.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, we will update this page and the date above. Continued
        use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
